# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — keep the build context honest and small (M0-08).
#
# فارسی: چیزی که به داکر فرستاده نمی‌شود؛ کانتکست کوچک = بیلد سریع و تمیز.
#
# Rules behind each entry:
# - .venv/            : Windows wheels are useless inside the linux container;
#                       the builder stage re-compiles from requirements/.
# - __pycache__/*.pyc : stale bytecode must never leak into an image layer.
# - .pytest_cache/.coverage : local test artifacts, not source.
# - sqlite db files   : dev leftovers would silently satisfy imports in CI.
#
# DELIBERATELY KEPT in context (do NOT add):
# - tests/            : the `test` stage runs pytest inside the image.
# - requirements/     : the builder stage copies it first (layer-cache anchor).
# =============================================================================

.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.sqlite3
db.sqlite3
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
